ute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687797","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5013610-1846651706682983","game_id":"steam-5013610","kind":"announcement","title":"Round two: real mini-boss fights and a clearer mine","summary":"You kept playing and kept writing to us. Thank you! This second update is built from that new feedback. \"Mini-bosses are just a button\" 6 brand-new mini-bosses, each one a different mini-game: a boxing duel, a rhythm fight, a stealth game in the dark, a memory game, a shooting gallery and a chase. Each boss has its own arena, its own music, an intro cutscene and 3 phases that change the rules. Every attack is clearly announced, the rule is shown in one line and the first attack plays in slow mot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T20:14:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682983","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5013610-1846651706676438","game_id":"steam-5013610","kind":"update","title":"You asked, we listened: big demo update","summary":"Thanks for all your feedback on the demo! This update is built from it. A big step forward for the interface Brand new step-by-step tutorial that explains every part of the screen Clearer quota: an hourglass shows the exp Cleaner screen: simpler hold panel and far fewer pop-ups Your first building is free, and the license tree and relic shop now guide you New gameplay Combo rush: drill fast and the screen heats up Hold overload: keep drilling past full, but every extra ore heats your drill Also ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T05:45:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5013610-1846651706673799","game_id":"steam-5013610","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: FPS limit, Restart button, cleaner pause menu","summary":"Thanks for playing the GreeDrill demo and for all the feedback. Here is what changed.PerformanceNew FPS LIMIT setting: 60, 120, 144, 240 or Uncapped (144 by default). The demo no longer runs your GPU at full load.The game drops to 15 FPS while its window is in the background.RestartRestart the current level from the pause menu, in a brand new mine. Your licenses and coins are kept.Pause menuSimpler pause menu: Resume, Restart, Settings, Quit to menu. Sound, display and language are under Setting","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T10:07:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673799","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:19:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5013610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:32Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5013610":"2026-10-26T07:14:32Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5013610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:32Z"},"5028580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:32Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5013610","app_id":5013610,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:16Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","lang